==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|nítján|lang=non}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} {{recons|newuntehun|lang=gem-pro}}.

===Cardinal number===
'''nítján''' {{indecl}}

# '''[[nineteen]]'''; the cardinal number after [[átján#Icelandic|átján]] and before [[tuttugu#Icelandic|tuttugu]].

====Related terms====
* (''ordinal form'') [[nítjándi]] {{m}}, [[nítjánda]] {{f|n}}.

